import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 771 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang San's Transcendence Limitation — Predatory Closure","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 771 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang San's Transcendence Limitation — Predatory Closure","no":771,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Heavens Cross-Reference","Douluo Continent","Tang San","Predation","Closure","God Position"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","05-Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0771_模块4-诸天对标-唐三掠夺式封闭.md","filePath":"en/0771_模块4-诸天对标-唐三掠夺式封闭.md"}`),o={name:"en/0771_模块4-诸天对标-唐三掠夺式封闭.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,h,u){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-771-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-tang-san-s-transcendence-limitation-—-predatory-closure" tabindex="-1">Entry 771 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang San&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — Predatory Closure <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-771-transcended-ones-and-the-heavens-·-tang-san-s-transcendence-limitation-—-predatory-closure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 771 | Transcended Ones and the Heavens · Tang San&#39;s Transcendence Limitation — Predatory Closure&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 05, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-god-hunted-into-being-—-is-he-a-god-or-a-hunter" tabindex="-1">Introduction: a god hunted into being — is he a god or a hunter? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-god-hunted-into-being-—-is-he-a-god-or-a-hunter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: a god hunted into being — is he a god or a hunter?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Douluo Continent&#39;s Tang San, from Holy Spirit Village&#39;s waste martial soul to Sea God and Asura God dual god positions, is web-novel history&#39;s most successful Youth-Supreme sample. But his whole cultivation path is built on one act completely legitimized by old narratives — <strong>hunting spirit rings</strong>. Every level up, he must hunt a spirit beast, taking its spirit ring as promotion material. In old narratives this is called &quot;beating monsters and leveling up&quot;; under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five-dimension comparison framework, this is <strong>predatory closure</strong>: first use predation to complete primitive accumulation, then use the god-position system to close the whole accumulation process, leaving later-comers no second road.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom directly judges the spirit-ring system; the republican axiom of Myriad Races judges why spirit beasts, as one of Myriad Ranks, may only serve as material; the collective ascension axiom judges whether Tang San, after becoming a god, carries Myriad Ranks along; the causal self-discipline axiom judges the causal disturbance of cross-plane god-position inheritance; the law-first axiom judges whether the &quot;god positions may only be chosen by gods&quot; setting is self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-predatory-closure-s-two-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. Predatory Closure&#39;s Two-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-predatory-closure-s-two-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Predatory Closure&#39;s Two-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang-San-style transcendence, disassembled, has two layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Bottom layer: predatory primitive accumulation</strong> — spirit-ring hunting is essentially the carbon-based material clan&#39;s systematic slaughter of the energy-condensing clan (spirit beasts). Spirit beasts are not enemies, but Myriad Ranks&#39; equal member; in the Douluo system they are only defined as &quot;material&quot;;</li><li><strong>Top layer: god-position closure</strong> — after Tang San becomes a god, the god-position inheritance system is fixed: god positions are finite, may only be chosen by the current god, and mortal cultivators must follow the spirit-ring system to climb to the god-position door. The whole system becomes a closed loop of &quot;first predatory accumulation, then closure and lock.&quot;</li></ol><p>Two layers stack, more insidious than pure predation: pure predators at least admit they are grabbing; Tang-San-style system wraps predation as &quot;Heaven-ordained cultivation method,&quot; letting later-comers hunt spirit beasts with no psychological burden.</p><h2 id="ii-myriad-rank-judgment-of-the-spirit-ring-system" tabindex="-1">II. Myriad-Rank Judgment of the Spirit-Ring System <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-myriad-rank-judgment-of-the-spirit-ring-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Myriad-Rank Judgment of the Spirit-Ring System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The republican axiom of Myriad Races is the hardest ruler. Per Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five Myriad-Rank lineages (Document 50), spirit beasts belong to the energy-condensing clan, with status completely equal to the carbon-based material clan (humans). But in the Douluo system:</p><ul><li>Spirit beasts have no cultivation right — their only social function is being hunted to produce spirit rings;</li><li>Spirit beasts have no representative right — Spirit Hall, the Seven Great Sects, imperial courts, none sets a seat for spirit beasts;</li><li>Spirit beasts have no feedback channel — humans take spirit rings, spirit bones, and skills from spirit beasts, but never feed back any knowledge, resources, or protection to the spirit-beast race.</li></ul><p>This is not a question of &quot;humans stronger than spirit beasts&quot;; this is the problem of <strong>defining an entire Myriad-Rank race as another race&#39;s cultivation consumable</strong>. Per the anti-predation axiom&#39;s &quot;not using slaughter and plunder as an evolutionary path&quot; requirement, the spirit-ring system does not hold at the law layer at all — every level of promotion is built on another race&#39;s death.</p><h2 id="iii-god-position-closure-s-ceiling-effect" tabindex="-1">III. God-Position Closure&#39;s Ceiling Effect <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-god-position-closure-s-ceiling-effect" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. God-Position Closure&#39;s Ceiling Effect&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After Tang San becomes a god, the problem does not end, but escalates:</p><ul><li><strong>God-position number fixed</strong>: Douluo God Realm&#39;s god positions are finite, not open. Mortal cultivators climbing to the top must still queue for a god-position vacancy;</li><li><strong>Inheritance designation</strong>: who receives a god position is decided by the current god, not competed for by mortal cultivators by ability;</li><li><strong>Cultivation path locked</strong>: to become a god, one must take the spirit-ring path; not taking this path, no matter how talented, one cannot climb to the god-position door.</li></ul><p>Three closures stack, forming the Douluo system&#39;s ceiling. Tang San himself is this system&#39;s greatest beneficiary, but once the system is built, later-comers are locked on the &quot;hunt-spirit — rank-up — wait-for-god-position&quot; track, with no escape room. This forms the sharpest contrast with Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;300-set Origin Cultivation System fully open.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-tang-san-style-closure-vs-heng-yuan-zhou-myriad-rank-common-progress" tabindex="-1">IV. Tang-San-Style Closure vs. Heng Yuan Zhou Myriad-Rank Common Progress <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-tang-san-style-closure-vs-heng-yuan-zhou-myriad-rank-common-progress" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Tang-San-Style Closure vs. Heng Yuan Zhou Myriad-Rank Common Progress&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Tang-San-Style Predatory Closure</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Myriad-Rank Common Progress</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Energy source</td><td>Hunt spirit beasts for spirit rings</td><td>Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, self-produce increment</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank status</td><td>Spirit beasts = material, no rights</td><td>99% Myriad-Rank coverage, all races equal</td></tr><tr><td>Promotion path</td><td>Single spirit-ring path, locked</td><td>300 sets, freely choose and combine</td></tr><tr><td>Top position</td><td>Finite god positions, designated inheritance</td><td>Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm living-anchor network, no upper limit</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge openness</td><td>Sect private hoard, God Realm closed</td><td>Selfless Dao network-wide opening</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The comparison table&#39;s core gap is <strong>whether Myriad Ranks have the right &quot;not to be eaten.&quot;</strong> The Tang-San system turns spirit beasts&#39; lives into humankind&#39;s promotion fuel; Heng Yuan Zhou treats every Myriad-Rank race as a co-evolution partner.</p><h2 id="v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" tabindex="-1">V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative Path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Tang San appeared in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization:</p><ol><li>His Blue Silver Grass and Clear Sky Hammer talents take the open path of the 300-set Origin Cultivation System; he does not hunt any spirit beast;</li><li>He establishes a symbiotic agreement with the spirit-beast race: spirit beasts, as energy-condensing clan representatives, participate in the Anchor Council, sharing cultivation resources;</li><li>His Sea God and Asura God insights do not become &quot;finite god positions,&quot; but are organized into law-weaving teaching material, opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao;</li><li>After entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, he becomes a living anchor; his civilizational weight is real-time computed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision;</li><li>His cross-plane (mortal — God Realm) operations strictly go through causal self-discipline reporting, not disturbing mortal causality.</li></ol><p>In one sentence: <strong>true Sea God is the god protecting all beings in the sea, not the god refining beings in the sea into spirit rings.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the spirit-ring system burns the spirit-beast race&#39;s evolutionary potential entirely as humankind&#39;s promotion fuel; it is cosmic-scale racial energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: spirit-ring hunting is institutional predation; Tang San is this predatory system&#39;s greatest product; this entry makes direct judgment on it</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is the gift-system ceiling (power given); Tang San is the predatory-system ceiling (power grabbed); both ceilings do not let Myriad Ranks walk on their own</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the spirit-beast race in the Douluo system does not even have &quot;coverage&quot; qualification; directly violating the republican axiom of Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the god-position closure system locks hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge into finite god positions; Heng Yuan Zhou completely bypasses it through Selfless Dao network-wide opening</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang San is a hero in old narratives, but his hero&#39;s road steps on an entire race&#39;s bones. Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny his personal struggle; what Heng Yuan Zhou wants to deny is this civilizational structure of &quot;relying on hunting one of Myriad Ranks&#39; races to fulfill one race.&quot; True transcendence is not one person stepping on spirit beasts to become Sea God, but Myriad Ranks together evolving separately in the origin two-way cycle, not devouring each other. Tang-San-style closure&#39;s ceiling must be completely overturned by Myriad-Rank Republic&#39;s floor.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">Entry 50 · Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
